{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/104127","repository_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot","labels_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/104127/labels{/name}","comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/104127/comments","events_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/104127/events","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/104127","id":2920644662,"node_id":"PR_kwDOAO6SJc6Osgwp","number":104127,"title":"Remove `String` clipping constructors.","user":{"login":"Ivorforce","id":2308167,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjIzMDgxNjc=","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/2308167?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Ivorforce","html_url":"https://github.com/Ivorforce","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Ivorforce/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Ivorforce/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Ivorforce/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Ivorforce/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Ivorforce/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Ivorforce/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Ivorforce/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Ivorforce/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Ivorforce/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"labels":[{"id":73330066,"node_id":"MDU6TGFiZWw3MzMzMDA2Ng==","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/labels/enhancement","name":"enhancement","color":"aaccff","default":true,"description":"","archived_at":null,"archived_by":null},{"id":279097966,"node_id":"MDU6TGFiZWwyNzkwOTc5NjY=","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/labels/topic:core","name":"topic:core","color":"ffee88","default":false,"description":"","archived_at":null,"archived_by":null}],"state":"closed","locked":false,"assignees":[],"milestone":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/milestones/22","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/milestone/22","labels_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/milestones/22/labels","id":12070367,"node_id":"MI_kwDOAO6SJc4AuC3f","number":22,"title":"4.5","description":"","creator":{"login":"Sauermann","id":6299227,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjYyOTkyMjc=","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/6299227?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Sauermann","html_url":"https://github.com/Sauermann","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Sauermann/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Sauermann/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Sauermann/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Sauermann/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Sauermann/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Sauermann/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Sauermann/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Sauermann/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Sauermann/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"open_issues":3,"closed_issues":3687,"state":"closed","created_at":"2024-12-19T08:51:28Z","updated_at":"2026-09-04T21:48:38Z","due_on":"2025-09-15T00:00:00Z","closed_at":"2025-09-18T17:13:14Z"},"comments":1,"created_at":"2025-03-14T16:05:03Z","updated_at":"2025-03-19T11:41:30Z","closed_at":"2025-03-19T11:37:52Z","assignee":null,"author_association":"MEMBER","issue_field_values":[],"type":null,"active_lock_reason":null,"draft":false,"pull_request":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/104127","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/104127","diff_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/104127.diff","patch_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/104127.patch","merged_at":"2025-03-19T11:37:52Z"},"body":"I've been eyeing this one for a while. With `Span` finally merged, I think it's time to cut these constructors.\r\n\r\n## Explanation of `String(a, x)`\r\n\r\nThis constructor constructs a `String` of some encoding (`latin1` for `char`, `UTF 32` for `char32_t`) given a length.\r\nHowever, it mistrusts the length, and first iterates the string if it finds any `\\0` characters in it. If so, it cuts the string early.\r\n\r\nThis is somewhat odd in several ways:\r\n- It is slow to iterate the whole string, when the length is already known.\r\n- If `\\0` is found, the returned string will have a different length than expected.\r\n- `\\0` characters are technically valid `UTF 32` (although we currently replace them with `0xfffd`, the designated replacement character).\r\n\r\nThere are theoretically situations where the clipping `String` constructor would be useful.\r\nHowever, all callers (as far as I can tell) have a known length and do not need to mistrust the given string. If the string cuts off early, this is a mistake, and should be logged. This is the case in parsing constructors (they print errors on `NUL` characters).\r\nI think it likely that callers of this constructor assumed it is a known-length constructor, and did not know that the string would be parsed again unnecessarily. This behavior used to be somewhat hidden.\r\n\r\nI think it is appropriate to remove these constructors.\r\nOther than the odd behavior and waste of cycles for re-parsing the string, it is good to be explicit with encodings. Callers should be thinking about which specific encoding they're given, and use that encoding instead of relying on types exclusively (where `char` defaults to `latin1` (which is somewhat rare) instead of `ascii` or `utf8`).\r\n\r\n\r\n## Notes\r\nI did a cursory internet search for info about the contexts where I replaced `latin1` parsing with `ascii`. It would be good if somebody double checked that I did not make any encoding blunders.","closed_by":{"login":"akien-mga","id":4701338,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjQ3MDEzMzg=","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/4701338?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga","html_url":"https://github.com/akien-mga","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/104127/reactions","total_count":5,"+1":5,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"timeline_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/104127/timeline","performed_via_github_app":null,"state_reason":null}